      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Danvers became a stop on the electric interurban railroad in 1907, and the Illinois Traction System kept running long after similar lines closed.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
